flowchart TB
    Browser[React + Vite browser client]
    Router[React Router<br/>protected role routes]
    Axios[Axios API client<br/>HttpOnly session cookie]
    Spring[Spring Boot REST API<br/>Security · DTO validation · services]
    JPA[Spring Data JPA / Hibernate]
    MySQL[(MySQL relational database)]
    Vite[Vite development server :3000<br/>proxies /api to Spring Boot :8080]
    Static[React production build<br/>bundled into Spring static resources]

    Browser --> Router --> Axios
    Axios -->|Development| Vite
    Vite -->|/api proxy| Spring
    Axios -.->|Production same-origin /api| Spring
    Static -.->|served by| Spring
    Spring --> JPA --> MySQL
